<title>VENEZUELA: RESEARCH ALERT-Ceramica Carabobo started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Ceramica Carabobo started.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais said it started coverage of Venezuelan ceramic tiles manufacturer Ceramica Carabobo as a hold.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Reinaldo Santana said, &quot;The construction sector in Venezuela is expected to grow 5.9 percent in 1997 and 6.4 percent in 1998. However, Ceramica's tile volumes are unlikely to reflect the sector's positive trends until 1998.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Ceramica was unchanged today at 500 bolivars.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
